art", "D": "Rule book of passes"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qykr92xe9e"}, {"q": "Financial powers of officers are:", "options": {"A": "Higher for juniors", "B": "Graded by rank as per delegation", "C": "Unlimited", "D": "Same for all"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qf5xqcr2inq"}, {"q": "Expenditure beyond delegated powers is sanctioned by the:", "options": {"A": "Vendor", "B": "Railway Board", "C": "Bank", "D": "Court"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qhm3wj1z5n0"}, {"q": "Expenditure not submitted to vote is:", "options": {"A": "Donated", "B": "Charged on the Consolidated Fund", "C": "Written off", "D": "Voted"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qjhl2wlosqq"}, {"q": "Railway demands for grants are:", "options": {"A": "Charged", "B": "Voted", "C": "Secret", "D": "Donated"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qczf58ukzqu"}, {"q": "Demands for grants are voted by the:", "options": {"A": "Court", "B": "Lok Sabha", "C": "Bank", "D": "Rajya Sabha"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qusf6qjygh8"}, {"q": "Cut motions are moved in the:", "options": {"A": "Rajya Sabha", "B": "Lok Sabha", "C": "Court", "D": "Bank"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q7j5e5v1d34"}, {"q": "Closure of budget discussion by putting all demands to vote is called:", "options": {"A": "Vote", "B": "Guillotine", "C": "Donation", "D": "Debate"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qfl8vxi2z35"}, {"q": "Withdrawal from the Consolidated Fund is authorised by the:", "options": {"A": "Finance Bill", "B": "Appropriation Bill", "C": "Ticket Bill", "D": "Pass Bill"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q16zbf55wmu"}, {"q": "Expenditure from the Consolidated Fund needs an:", "options": {"A": "Motion", "B": "Appropriation Act", "C": "Notice", "D": "Resolution"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qt0yc7zt90y"}, {"q": "Tax proposals of the budget are given effect by the:", "options": {"A": "Pass Bill", "B": "Appropriation Bill", "C": "Finance Bill", "D": "Ticket Bill"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q10sbx8oidpt"}, {"q": "Interim provision before the budget is passed is called:", "options": {"A": "Full budget", "B": "Donation", "C": "Vote on account", "D": "Loan"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q23h4nlj2bkt"}, {"q": "Vote on account usually covers:", "options": {"A": "One week", "B": "One day", "C": "About two months", "D": "Ten years"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qysclrqs052"}, {"q": "Supplementary demands are presented:", "options": {"A": "Never", "B": "Once in 10 years", "C": "During the year as needed", "D": "After 50 years"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q2d25s3i6c11"}, {"q": "Unforeseen urgent expenditure is met initially by:", "options": {"A": "Fines", "B": "Donations", "C": "Advances from the Contingency Fund", "D": "Loans"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1ndjfibhjzp"}, {"q": "Contingency Fund advances are:", "options": {"A": "Written off", "B": "Donated", "C": "Recouped after Parliament approval", "D": "Doubled"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qww3hjvr4l5"}, {"q": "The Contingency Fund of India is held on behalf of the:", "options": {"A": "Court", "B": "Vendor", "C": "President", "D": "Bank"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qfrzgoovyky"}, {"q": "New works announced in the budget:", "options": {"A": "Automatic", "B": "Banned", "C": "Need token provision and Parliament approval", "D": "Donated"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qw5a1k23561"}, {"q": "Sanctioned railway works are listed in the:", "options": {"A": "Pass book", "B": "Time table", "C": "Pink Book", "D": "Fare chart"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1zqxres1qfs"}, {"q": "New projects are justified through:", "options": {"A": "Guesswork", "B": "Vendor advice", "C": "Financial appraisal and rate of return", "D": "Astrology"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1z4ypfjl5pp"}, {"q": "D and G charges on works stand for:", "options": {"A": "Donation", "B": "Bonus", "C": "Direction and General charges", "D": "Fine"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1e9uyqi4bj4"}, {"q": "Cost assessment before a new line project needs a:", "options": {"A": "Ticket", "B": "Pass", "C": "Survey estimate", "D": "Bonus"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qm3a2vsac3f"}, {"q": "Sanction of a work needs a:", "options": {"A": "Court", "B": "Vendor", "C": "Detailed e